        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Loudspeakers, Marcy Playground\n- People: Gvaji, John Wozniak, Dylan Keefe, Shlomi Lavie, Irakli Charkviani, Nino Katamadze, Sergi Gvarjaladze, Katie Melua, Nika Kocharov, Sophie Villy\n- Topics: Rock music, alternative rock, Georgian artists\n\nFacts:\n- Loudspeakers, stylised as LOUDspeakers, is a Georgian rock band formed in 2009.\n- Marcy Playground is an American alternative rock band whose members are John Wozniak, Dylan Keefe, and Shlomi Lavie.\n- Marcy Playground is best known for its 1997 hit \"Sex and Candy.\"\n- Gvaji has worked with Georgian artists and bands including Irakli Charkviani, Nino Katamadze, Sergi Gvarjaladze, Katie Melua, Nika Kocharov & Young Georgian Lolitaz, Loudspeakers, and Sophie Villy.",
